# Ignore everything in .claude/ so personal rules and skills stay local.
*

# Except specific files, plus the dirs whose own .gitignore allowlists the
# shared entries by name. Never add `!rules/**` here — that un-ignores every
# developer's personal, uncommitted entries. To share a new rule, allowlist
# it in rules/.gitignore.
!.gitignore
!settings.json
!rules
